This is an Cheirurus with a scale of around 1:1 (75 mm).
The sculpture was based on scientific works and a bit of my perception as a biologist.
The animal was made to be made on resin printers. However, with a larger scale it is possible to do in FDM printers.
You will receive 4 files (STL format) containing:

  - Dorsal carapace;

  - Ventral legs;

  - Base;

  - Scale bar for scale checking in slicing programs.

I hope you like it!

Cell:
