High-quality stylized 3D models of human X and Y chromosomes with detailed organic surfaces. Perfect for medical visualization, scientific animation, educational content, and biotechnology projects.
Features:

  - High-resolution detailed organic surface;

  - Clean topology;

  - Ready for close-up renders;

  - Easy to integrate into scientific scenes;

  - All objects are organized and named descriptively;

  - The scene is prepared for Render;

  - Subdivision level 2;

  - Clean, non-overlapping UVs; 

  - High-Resolution 4K texture maps: Base Color, Normal, Displacement, Roughness, Ambient Occlusion, and a bonus ORM map (Packed Roughness/Metallic/AO for Unreal Engine).
